OL,3,GNEWSADeal made in refuse workers' pay
OL,4,Adispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pay offer has been agreed with waste
OL,7,Fcollectors and street cleaners who were
OL,8,Fdue to go on strike, a council has
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FOne third of Great Yarmouth Services
OL,12,F(GYS) workers, including landscapers
OL,13,Fand grave diggers, withdrew their
OL,14,Flabour earlier this month after their
OL,15,Fdemand for a 20% pay increase was
OL,16,Frejected.
OL,18,FPlanned strikes by GYS were called-off
OL,19,Fon Wednesday for pay negotiation talks.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
