OL,3,GNEWSADeal made in refuse workers' pay
OL,4,Adispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe details of the new deal have not
OL,7,Fbeen made public, but Great Yarmouth
OL,8,FBorough Council, which own GYS,
OL,9,Fpreviously offered a 3.3% rise for
OL,10,Fworkers.
